ylist?list=PLME-KWdxI8dcaHSzzRsNuOLXtM2Ep_C7a\" target=\"_blank\">ash Course Computer Science </a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8dPuuaLjXtPTrc_yg73RghJEOdobAplG\" target=\"_blank\">Crash Course Games</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Geography</span></span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.coursera.org%2Flearn%2Fmountains-101&amp;t=ZjVmY2U1ODg3OTMzMDdiMDA3NTlmZmZlNzZiMTQ4NmE5YmEzYTY2YSx3WXZhbml1cQ%3D%3D&amp;b=t%3Adpg2Y_ZoazecWjw3yfuk9g&amp;p=http%3A%2F%2Fdailyplanescape.tumblr.com%2Fpost%2F161295099211%2Fnon-fiction-resources-for-eberron&amp;m=0\" target=\"_blank\">Mountains 101</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">History </span></span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/internet-history\" target=\"_blank\">Internet History, Technology, and Security</a>: For the Network Zero fans.</li> <li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/magic-middle-ages\" target=\"_blank\">Magic in the Middle Ages</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">History of Specific Nations</span></span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.thegreatcoursesplus.com/foundations-of-eastern-civilization\" target=\"_blank\">Foundations of Eastern Civilization</a>: An excellent introduction and overview. Mostly focuses on China, but also covers Japan, Korea, Mongolia and Southeast Asia.</li> <li><a href=\"https://www.thegreatcoursesplus.com/show/history_of_ancient_egypt\" target=\"_blank\">History of Ancient Egypt</a>: Everyone knows how awesome the course is, and Bob Brier is an excellent speaker, even if some of his hypotheses about King Tut have been refuted since this was originally made.</li> <li><a href=\"https://www.thegreatcoursesplus.com/history-of-the-united-states\" target=\"_blank\">History of the United States 2nd Edition</a>: If you aren\u2019t American and are running a chronicle in the States that remotely relies on history, this is an incredibly comprehensive course and probably worth the $15/month subscription to GC+ on its own.</li> <li><a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.coursera.org%2Flearn%2Findigenous-canada&amp;t=N2NiMTdiZjIyMzU2YzIyYzY2NzE5OGQ1YTdlMDM2NWEyYmYzZDYyZCx3WXZhbml1cQ%3D%3D&amp;b=t%3Adpg2Y_ZoazecWjw3yfuk9g&amp;p=http%3A%2F%2Fdailyplanescape.tumblr.com%2Fpost%2F161295099211%2Fnon-fiction-resources-for-eberron&amp;m=0\" target=\"_blank\">Indigenous Canada</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/introancientegypt\" target=\"_blank\">Introduction to Ancient Egypt and Its Civilisation</a></li> <li><a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thegreatcoursesplus.com%2Fmaya-to-aztec-ancient-mesoamerica-revealed&amp;t=MDA3NzYwZjFmY2ZmNWI3ODMzYTM5ODRkZDE1OTc5M2M5NDFmZjA5NCxXSjhSMVpmNw%3D%3D&amp;b=t%3Adpg2Y_ZoazecWjw3yfuk9g&amp;p=http%3A%2F%2Fdailyplanescape.tumblr.com%2Fpost%2F161358760096%2Fnon-fiction-resources-for-chronicles-of-darkness&amp;m=0\" target=\"_blank\">Maya to Aztec - Ancient Mesoamerica Revealed</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.thegreatcoursesplus.com/show/understanding_japan_a_cultural_history\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding Japan - A Cultural History</a></li> </ul><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Religion and Mythology</span></span></span></span><ul><li><a href=\"http://t.umblr.com/redirect?z=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fplaylist%3Flist%3DPL8dPuuaLjXtNCG9Vq7vdvJytS-F-xGi7_&amp;t=NDg3NGE2ZDY5NThmMWQ3NDMwMjNkYTllY2E1YWZlMjQwOWFjMDVhMix3WXZhbml1cQ%3D%3D&amp;b=t%3Adpg2Y_ZoazecWjw3yfuk9g&amp;p=http%3A%2F%2Fdailyplanescape.tumblr.com%2Fpost%2F161295099211%2Fnon-fiction-resources-for-eberron&amp;m=0\" target=\"_blank\">Crash Course Mythology</a>: Each gameline draws on mythology in its own way, so CC Mythology is fairly broadly applicable.</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 06-14-2017, 12:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-03T19:23:13-07:00","id":1099985,"title":"","content":"I just did a major update and reorganisation that hopefully makes th