ritten right the panic was finally burning out, so it has the benefit of being fresh in the memories of those involved. For a work that the benefit of more time passing and more facts and research into the panic coming out as a result, look for <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/We-Believe-Children-Moral-Panic/dp/1610392876\" target=\"_blank\">We Believe the Children: A Moral Panic</a> in the 1980s","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 06-04-2017, 12:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T09:19:01-07:00","id":1100158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1099572-non-fiction-online-resources-for-chronicle-of-darkness?p=1100146#post1100146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to suggest the CNN decades series, which is on Netflix. It makes for a very good highlights reel/cliff notes of the 70s and 80s for those that weren't around for those decades or were too young to remember them, but it is fairly surface level beginner stuff for someone who was around for those events. The 80s season in particular has episodes that focus on 80s issues that are particularly relevant to a New Wave Requiem chronicle and the episodes What's Going On and Cults and Crimes of the 70s are a good resource for Bowery Dogs campaigns.<br /> <br /> Also <a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amazon.com/Satans-Silence-Ritual-Making-American/dp/0595189555&quot;]Satan's</a> Silence [/URL]is the definitive work on the Satanic Panic and was written right the panic was finally burning out, so it has the benefit of being fresh in the memories of those involved. For a work that the benefit of more time passing and more facts and research into the panic coming out as a result, look for <a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amazon.com/We-Believe-Children-Moral-Panic/dp/1610392876&quot;]We</a> Believe the Children: A Moral Panic[/URL] in the 1980s</div> </div> </div> </div>Those sounds like excellent resources! <br /> <br /> I'm not going to link To Netflix series since those tend to be highly localized (indeed, I can't find any of these series on Canadian Netflix), but I'm hoping they may be streaming on CNN Go. I'll have to take a look, but they are a really good addition. I may add them without the link. <br /> <br /> Has the Satanic Panic been featured yet in any books? If not, I'm probably going to hold off on adding those other two since I could conceivably link to every single interesting point in history and make the list impossibly unwieldy. That said, I am hedging my bets that the Satanic Panic will featured in Dark Eras 2, so even if it hasn't been meantioned yet, I will keep them in mind for the future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-04T09:28:52-07:00","id":1100161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\">